        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, through Eve Air Mobility, we are engaged in the development and certification of eVTOL aircraft, the establishment of a maintenance and service network for eVTOLs, and the development of an air traffic management system for urban air mobility (UAM).",
        "start_character": 15495,
        "end_character": 15758
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
