        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we also provide support aircraft services to passenger carriers from several government organizations.",
        "start_character": 119294,
        "end_character": 119410
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-021824-f1e11f9f8ce14fc7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-021824",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our evolution, we have obtained, developed and enhanced our engineering and technological capabilities through our own development of products for the Brazilian Air Force and through joint product development with foreign companies on specific projects.",
        "start_character": 4141,
        "end_character": 4405
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-021824-f1e11f9f8ce14fc7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-021824",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of the integrated support program, we also provide services to new and existing customers of our Super Tucano, which is an aircraft used by several air forces around the world.",
        "start_character": 119109,
        "end_character": 119293
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-021824-f1e11f9f8ce14fc7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-021824",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As the number of our aircraft in operation continues to grow and our business expands, we have increased our commitment to provide quality after-sale support, including technical assistance, training, maintenance, spare parts, product modifications and other related services.",
        "start_character": 37932,
        "end_character": 38208
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-021824-f1e11f9f8ce14fc7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-021824",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By complying with the GHS, we ensure that our products are manufactured, handled, and transported in a safe and environmentally responsible manner.",
        "start_character": 189159,
        "end_character": 189306
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-021824-f1e11f9f8ce14fc7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-021824",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Drawing upon the design of the EMB 120 Brasília and the jet technology acquired in our development of the AM-X, a jet strike bomber for the Brazilian Air Force, we developed the ERJ 145 regional aircraft family, our first jet product for commercial use.",
        "start_character": 5622,
        "end_character": 5875
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-021824-f1e11f9f8ce14fc7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-021824",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For instance, we have support services designed to fulfill requirements, including sale of spare parts, maintenance, training and technical support, among others, relating to (i) recent aircraft Phenom 100, Phenom 300, Legacy 450;",
        "start_character": 119411,
        "end_character": 119641
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-021824-f1e11f9f8ce14fc7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-021824",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the criteria of business excellence, we have maintained the ISO 45001 certifications in its largest manufacturing units for 20 years.",
        "start_character": 155005,
        "end_character": 155153
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-021824-f1e11f9f8ce14fc7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-021824",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The key competitive factors in the markets in which we participate include design and technological strength, aircraft operational costs, aircraft price, including financing costs, customer service and manufacturing efficiency.",
        "start_character": 63361,
        "end_character": 63588
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-021824-f1e11f9f8ce14fc7",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-021824",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To support this, we have developed a “Design for the Environment” guide, available to engineers from the earliest stages of product development.",
        "start_character": 188612,
        "end_character": 188756
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-021824",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-021824-f1e11f9f8ce14fc7",
